    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great new Match-3 game from &quot;eFunsoft Games&quot;! Stan is just an average guy working a late-night shift as a guard at the local museum. It can be a dull job, but he finds ways to pass the time. Even now, one day away from the museum\u2019s grand opening, he doesn\u2019t expect anything to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he knocks down a strange tablet the museum had on display, all of the museum\u2019s artifacts are pulled into a mysterious portal. This is a catastrophe, especially so close to the grand opening\u2026 and he knows who will be blamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save his job and the museum, Stan has no choice but to plunge into the portal\u2026 only to find himself in a world of mythology. If he wants the museum\u2019s artifacts back, he\u2019ll need to contend with the gods themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lighthearted, comedic story of a modern-day museum guard dealing with the gods and goddesses of Greek mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five chapters follow Stan\u2019s quest to reclaim the lost artifacts, with twenty upgrades as you retrieve each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fun match-3 puzzles let you test your skills and use a variety of tools to clear each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New mysteries and wonders await on this journey to save the museum before its grand opening.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great new Match-3 game from &quot;eFunsoft Games&quot;! Stan is just an average guy working a late-night shift as a guard at the local museum. It can be a dull job, but he finds ways to pass the time. Even now, one day away from the museum\u2019s grand opening, he doesn\u2019t expect anything to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when he knocks down a strange tablet the museum had on display, all of the museum\u2019s artifacts are pulled into a mysterious portal. This is a catastrophe, especially so close to the grand opening\u2026 and he knows who will be blamed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save his job and the museum, Stan has no choice but to plunge into the portal\u2026 only to find himself in a world of mythology. If he wants the museum\u2019s artifacts back, he\u2019ll need to contend with the gods themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lighthearted, comedic story of a modern-day museum guard dealing with the gods and goddesses of Greek mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Five chapters follow Stan\u2019s quest to reclaim the lost artifacts, with twenty upgrades as you retrieve each one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fun match-3 puzzles let you test your skills and use a variety of tools to clear each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- New mysteries and wonders await on this journey to save the museum before its grand opening.</p>",
